      "id": "claim_7fc6c13072d34670a6f46a1beee1c129",
      "statement": "The Rust→Python fallback is exception-driven: RustSmithWatermanAligner raises RuntimeError on ImportError (extension not built) or on missing exports (align_pair_details, align_batch_details), and 'auto' catches this to silently use SmithWatermanAligner.",
