    {
      "id": "claim_a55dc9a4dcc7448bb474baec8a9c907a",
      "statement": "In _process_answer_span (citations.py lines 227–677), three Rust fast paths are attempted in order: (1) rust_corpus.build_citations() when HAS_RUST_CORE, rust_corpus exists, method is present, and aligner is RustSmithWatermanAligner; (2) _core.rust_build_citations_fast() JSON path when the first path is unavailable but the extension exposes it; (3) pure-Python citation building as fallback when both Rust paths fail.",
      "evidence": [
