      "id": "claim_01ce41dee46f4a5f8223a9724591551f",
      "statement": "The rust_corpus field stays None when the Rust prepare fast path is not taken, which occurs when: (1) a custom tokenizer is used (not SimpleTokenizer), (2) a custom segmenter is used (not SimpleSegmenter), or (3) the Rust extension is unavailable or _from_sources_rust raised an exception.",
